-- Prover typeclass instances — Fenel-authored typed values.
--
-- expr-substrate Phase 6b — the 8→2 consolidation (roadmap § Proving +
-- solving, locked 2026-05-28). The eight per-proposition-shape `Prover`
-- instances (Prover PropSubset → decidableSetProver, Prover PropEq →
-- reductionProver, … Prover PartialEvaluatorSoundness →
-- partialEvaluatorSoundnessCheck) COLLAPSE to two strategy instances keyed
-- off the `ProofStrategy` ctor names:
--   - `Prover Structural` → `prover:structuralPropose` (the router that
--     dispatches internally by proposition shape; routers.fenel).
--   - `Prover Smt` → `prover:smtPropose` (the external-solver bridge stub).
--
-- `loadFenelModule` projects each to the legacy `SpecInstance { typeName =
-- "Prover", args, methods, label }` shape; the loader lifts a `label`
-- method-field into the `SpecInstance.label` slot (the Phase 3.2 rule). The
-- per-shape proposer functions (prover:decidableSetProver etc.) are
-- UNCHANGED — they're the delegates the Structural router calls; only the
-- dispatch INSTANCES collapsed.

structuralProverInstance : Prover Structural
structuralProverInstance = Prover { propose = prover.structuralPropose, label = "Structural Prover (dispatched by proposition shape)" }

smtProverInstance : Prover Smt
smtProverInstance = Prover { propose = prover.smtPropose, label = "SMT Prover (external-solver bridge stub)" }
